<title>LATVIA: VITRANSAUTO 1996 NET PROFIT 22,043 LATS.</title>
<headline>VITRANSAUTO 1996 NET PROFIT 22,043 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport firm Vitransauto 1996 net profit was 22,043 lats and its net turnover was 4.14 million lats, the stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The bourse did not give comparative figures for the company's results.</p>
<p>It said that the gross profit of the company was 99,823 lats and that the profit before extraordinary items and taxes was 30,051 lats.</p>
<p>The company's assets were 2.35 million lats, the bourse added.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
